(text "MAF connector (GX12-7): separate analog and frequency pins; the harness uses the one that matches the MAF." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d2858d24-c781-4b6d-8eb9-f2d4a92fac45))
(text "Bosch 0280218335 is analog 0-5 V, harness ID 1.0 k. JP2 adds a 5 V pull-up for open-collector frequency MAFs." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d365e2d4-04a9-4eb6-a6ca-7fd9a2a928a3))
