(text "Digimatic: ATtiny1616 runs firmware/digimatic-interface. JP4/JP5 pick direct (1-2, default) or the NPN inverter (2-3, fit Q)." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5195216b-16c1-4640-b2d6-1fd0ab661317))
